(7517028, 1200803, 30861, '<td valign="top">Dude, you''re going crazy....</td>', 'Dude, you''re going crazy....', '2017-06-05 01:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517055, 1200929, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2017-06-05 03:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517056, 1200873, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2017-06-05 03:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517057, 1200836, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2017-06-05 03:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517073, 1200929, 1647, '<td valign="top">Colours are great and the shallow DOF is kind of nice too, but that close portion just to the right of centre is frustrating because it''s close and out-of-focus.  I wonder if it should have been in focus.</td>', 'Colours are great and the shallow DOF is kind of nice too, but that close portion just to the right of centre is frustrating because it''s close and out-of-focus.  I wonder if it should have been in focus.', '2017-06-05 05:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517075, 1200529, 1647, '<td valign="top">The light and richness of colour create so much drama - great job</td>', 'The light and richness of colour create so much drama - great job', '2017-06-05 05:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517076, 1200917, 1647, '<td valign="top">Seems like a complex photo and technically well executed, but I''m struggling to understand what it''s trying to tell me because it''s hard to understand what I''m looking at even.</td>', 'Seems like a complex photo and technically well executed, but I''m struggling to understand what it''s trying to tell me because it''s hard to understand what I''m looking at even.', '2017-06-05 05:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517077, 1200915, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow - so much purple, such a great photo, especially the control of light</td>', 'Wow - so much purple, such a great photo, especially the control of light', '2017-06-05 05:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517078, 1200852, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great pic - I like the shallow DOF but would have preferred a bit more contrast by having a darker area behind the flower instead of the bright area which makes it a little hard to look at the flower itself.</td>', 'Great pic - I like the shallow DOF but would have preferred a bit more contrast by having a darker area behind the flower instead of the bright area which makes it a little hard to look at the flower itself.', '2017-06-05 05:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517079, 1200859, 1647, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t fault this from a technical perspective - great focus, colour that pops, great background.</td>', 'I couldn''t fault this from a technical perspective - great focus, colour that pops, great background.', '2017-06-05 05:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517080, 1200861, 1647, '<td valign="top">Quite dark and difficult to understand what I''m looking at unfortunately</td>', 'Quite dark and difficult to understand what I''m looking at unfortunately', '2017-06-05 05:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517081, 1200447, 1647, '<td valign="top">Just curious - why title it Yellow hedge, but then take the colour out?  Curious as to why the yellow was interesting enough to include in title but not leave in the image</td>', 'Just curious - why title it Yellow hedge, but then take the colour out?  Curious as to why the yellow was interesting enough to include in title but not leave in the image', '2017-06-05 05:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517082, 1200673, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think I''d personally like a bit more sharpness in this image - but I realise too that not everything has to be sharp.  Great pic</td>', 'I think I''d personally like a bit more sharpness in this image - but I realise too that not everything has to be sharp.  Great pic', '2017-06-05 05:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517083, 1200820, 1647, '<td valign="top">The blurry tips on the flower makes it look a bit like the shallow DOF was achieved in editing rather than in camera.  Quite possibly not the case but just puts me off a little compared to had the edges of the petals been sharp</td>', 'The blurry tips on the flower makes it look a bit like the shallow DOF was achieved in editing rather than in camera.  Quite possibly not the case but just puts me off a little compared to had the edges of the petals been sharp', '2017-06-05 05:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517084, 1200541, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great pic - not every flower pic has to include the entire flower in shot, and this is a great example of that</td>', 'Great pic - not every flower pic has to include the entire flower in shot, and this is a great example of that', '2017-06-05 05:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517085, 1200816, 1647, '<td valign="top">Gee, I''d just love a little more sharpness on that flower - the background is wonderful</td>', 'Gee, I''d just love a little more sharpness on that flower - the background is wonderful', '2017-06-05 05:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517086, 1200748, 1647, '<td valign="top">This pic has that problem where I''m not sure what the main object of focus should be - two heroes</td>', 'This pic has that problem where I''m not sure what the main object of focus should be - two heroes', '2017-06-05 05:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517088, 1200799, 1647, '<td valign="top">Bamm - look at that for an amazing capture of nature in action.  Focus is brilliant, colour brilliant, background excellent, and subject is second to none!</td>', 'Bamm - look at that for an amazing capture of nature in action.  Focus is brilliant, colour brilliant, background excellent, and subject is second to none!', '2017-06-05 05:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517090, 1200627, 1647, '<td valign="top">Would have been that little bit nicer if there was a touch more separation between foreground and background - perhaps some extra light on the foreground.  Great effort though</td>', 'Would have been that little bit nicer if there was a touch more separation between foreground and background - perhaps some extra light on the foreground.  Great effort though', '2017-06-05 05:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517091, 1200806, 1647, '<td valign="top">Sharp, bright, great control of DOF, great detail - excellent pic</td>', 'Sharp, bright, great control of DOF, great detail - excellent pic', '2017-06-05 05:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517092, 1200670, 1647, '<td valign="top">I just love the background in this pic - expansive and unspoilt.</td>', 'I just love the background in this pic - expansive and unspoilt.', '2017-06-05 05:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517093, 1200916, 1647, '<td valign="top">Looks great - not entirely sure why the Orchid is smoking but so be it!</td>', 'Looks great - not entirely sure why the Orchid is smoking but so be it!', '2017-06-05 05:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517094, 1200892, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great capture - I can only imagine the effort to capture this image.  Unfortunately I don''t think the flower is the hero of this shot because it''s largely hidden by the leaf and pointing the other way.  If only.</td>', 'Great capture - I can only imagine the effort to capture this image.  Unfortunately I don''t think the flower is the hero of this shot because it''s largely hidden by the leaf and pointing the other way.  If only.', '2017-06-05 05:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517095, 1200824, 1647, '<td valign="top">Love the colour, composition and detail of this image</td>', 'Love the colour, composition and detail of this image', '2017-06-05 05:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517096, 1200471, 1647, '<td valign="top">And here we see the rose, photographed about as well as a rose can possibly be photographed.  Nothing I can say will be improving your technique - stunning</td>', 'And here we see the rose, photographed about as well as a rose can possibly be photographed.  Nothing I can say will be improving your technique - stunning', '2017-06-05 05:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517097, 1200910, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great background and lovely colours.  Not the most "perfect" of flowers - but not all flowers are perfect are they</td>', 'Great background and lovely colours.  Not the most "perfect" of flowers - but not all flowers are perfect are they', '2017-06-05 05:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517099, 1200615, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great attempt at light - I would have loved a little more on the red portions of the flower too, but still really interesting</td>', 'Great attempt at light - I would have loved a little more on the red portions of the flower too, but still really interesting', '2017-06-05 05:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
