(7517291, 1200877, 1647, '<td valign="top">"Purple weed" - such a unlovely name for a wonderful hi-key capture of the flower.  Really like the framing, colour and level of detail.</td>', '"Purple weed" - such a unlovely name for a wonderful hi-key capture of the flower.  Really like the framing, colour and level of detail.', '2017-06-06 10:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
