(7517293, 1200803, 1647, '<td valign="top">Well, its certainly different and, whilst they definitely look like fake flowers, you can definitely get away with it in this capture.  The background, particularly with the inclusion of the golfer is excellent.  I never thought I would like a photo of fake flowers and golf balls - but this is executed so well!</td>', 'Well, its certainly different and, whilst they definitely look like fake flowers, you can definitely get away with it in this capture.  The background, particularly with the inclusion of the golfer is excellent.  I never thought I would like a photo of fake flowers and golf balls - but this is executed so well!', '2017-06-06 10:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7517294, 1200847, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great pic, but I would have liked the flowers to feature a little more prominently given the theme of the challenge</td>', 'Great pic, but I would have liked the flowers to feature a little more prominently given the theme of the challenge', '2017-06-06 10:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
