(7518162, 1200915, 65234, '<td valign="top">I often have a tough time photographing an Iris. They''re so spectacularly flamboyant, and beautiful both up close and far away. I''m not sure I have been able to capture the feel of one as well as this. I admire your composition greatly and the title is apt. Your Iris has personality :-)</td>', 'I often have a tough time photographing an Iris. They''re so spectacularly flamboyant, and beautiful both up close and far away. I''m not sure I have been able to capture the feel of one as well as this. I admire your composition greatly and the title is apt. Your Iris has personality :-)', '2017-06-10 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
