(7518190, 1200799, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little moth, and I see another bug hiding under the petals. I will admit that the addition of those critters really makes the image for me, and in my mind bugs and flowers are inextricably linked, so that''s OK.</td>', 'Cute little moth, and I see another bug hiding under the petals. I will admit that the addition of those critters really makes the image for me, and in my mind bugs and flowers are inextricably linked, so that''s OK.', '2017-06-10 12:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
