(7518193, 1200791, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely DOF and overall softness. Nit: on my screen the flower is an overwhelming magenta. Personally, I''d like the image better with a less saturated and/or color-shifted (like pale yellow or peach) flower color.</td>', 'Lovely DOF and overall softness. Nit: on my screen the flower is an overwhelming magenta. Personally, I''d like the image better with a less saturated and/or color-shifted (like pale yellow or peach) flower color.', '2017-06-10 12:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
