(7518429, 1200346, 156466, '<td valign="top">Guess you either got/loved this one or you didn''t. I did and had it on my front page. Very underappreciated and not deserving of a bottom half finish. I suppose sometimes you see something like this and think it''s a cop out from the category, but this works. If I''ve got a critique it would be that I might have brightened the the flowers and surrounding area just a touch.</td>', 'Guess you either got/loved this one or you didn''t. I did and had it on my front page. Very underappreciated and not deserving of a bottom half finish. I suppose sometimes you see something like this and think it''s a cop out from the category, but this works. If I''ve got a critique it would be that I might have brightened the the flowers and surrounding area just a touch.', '2017-06-12 11:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
