(7518480, 1200447, 113591, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mitalapo:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lustre:</b></div><hr/><i> Just curious - why title it Yellow hedge, but then take the colour out?  Curious as to why the yellow was interesting enough to include in title but not leave in the image </i></td></tr></table> <br/>because it attracts such questions, right? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yea, baby!</td>', 'Originally posted by mitalapo: Originally posted by Lustre: Just curious - why title it Yellow hedge, but then take the colour out?  Curious as to why the yellow was interesting enough to include in title but not leave in the image  because it attracts such questions, right?   yea, baby!', '2017-06-12 17:50:29.000000', NULL, 0),
